      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "Fixes #35172.\n\n`CCoinsViewDB::Cursor()` primed the first record without checking whether `GetKey()` succeeded, so a malformed first key in the coin keyspace was reported as valid. `Next()` already invalidates the cursor for the same failure.\n\nMirror that check in `Cursor()`, and add a regression test that writes a too-short `DB_COIN` key and checks the returned cursor is invalid.",
